// Paper example 071: Transpose with a precise shape

#noformat
#paper: 71
#mode: evaluation
#inlinetest:exclude Not an executable S_H/A example; see TestQuantifiedPaperIndex.
#skip
Dependent profile D (out of scope).

-- paper.cue.txt --
transpose(A, r in Nat, c in Nat): func(m: Matrix(A, r, c)) ->
    Matrix(A, c, r): {
        rows: m.cols
        cols: m.rows
        data: [
            for j in list.Range(0, m.cols, 1) {
                [for row in m.data {row[j]}]
            }
        ]
    }
